  turning points that have shaped who you are today. Whether you are debuti
 ng a piece from our workshop or simply coming to listen\, join us for a po
 werful night of community and creative expression. Throughout the night\, 
 we'll also have Bingo and GSP Trivia! Prizes\, food\, and drinks will be p
 rovided!\n\nIf you would like to participate in performing or showing your
  art piece\, complete this form: Open Mic Participant
