DTSTART;TZID=UTC:20260523T120000
DTEND;TZID=UTC:20260523T200000
DTSTAMP:20260519T041839
CREATED:20260130T185640Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260515T161301Z
UID:10000308-1779537600-1779566400@hatefreetogether.org
SUMMARY:UC Davis Black Family Day
DESCRIPTION:The UC Davis Black Family day is an event to celebrate Black excellence\, empowerment\, and community. It is open to students\, families\, and community members. The event will be hosted on the UC Davis Quad on May 23rd\, from Noon to 8 PM. \n  \nAttendees will enjoy a day full of entertainers and speakers\, honoring the Black community and building conversations around achievements and contemporary issues. Local vendors will be selling delicious food\, clothes\, books\, and much more. Organizations and clubs join the festivities to share information and host engaging activities. \n  \nGet ready to enjoy a day full of music\, good food\, and celebrations of Black culture. The UC Davis Black Family Day is free for all to attend. \n  \nAlso featuring DJ KweKu\, Ladies of Davis\, Afro Vibes\, Honey Steppers\, The NME Band\, and more. \nFor any inquiries\, contact: ucdblackfamilyday@ucdavis.edu
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/uc-davis-black-family-day/
LOCATION:UC Davis Quad\, 1 Shields Avenue\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/https___cdn.evbuc_.com_images_1101161593_508470267019_1_original.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"UC Davis Campus Groups": "https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=908796"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ucdavis_campusgroups
SUMMARY:Black Family Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T200000
UID:fe5e8f5537668c41a550670590946691592026_2:26:21_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Black Family Day 2026 — a celebration of Black c
 ulture\, community\, and excellence bringing together students\, alumni\, 
 families\, and community members.\n\n📍 UC Davis Quad \n📅 Saturday\, 
 May 23\, 2026\n⏰ 12 PM – 8 PM\n\n🌟 Theme: Built to Last: Black Stre
 ngth Through Time\n\nSince 1970\, Black Family Day has been a cornerstone 
 at UC Davis — fostering joy\, connection\, and unity through the celebra
 tion of Black culture and heritage.\n\n🎊 Enjoy food vendors\, craft boo
 ths\, family activities\, a mechanical bull\, live performances\, DJs\, da
 ncers\, poets\, alumni wine & jazz\, and more!\n\n🎶 Featuring Bino Ride
 aux (Los Angeles)\n\nAlso featuring DJ KweKu\, Ladies of Davis\, Afro Vibe
 s\, Honey Steppers\, The NME Band\, and more.\n\n⭐ Come celebrate cultur
 e\, honor legacy\, and uplift community — because our legacy is Built to
  Last
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=908796
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
